@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Identity in reality vs. a doxastic and a conjectural world (Superman-style).
:S { :canFly a owl:ObjectProperty . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:superman owl:sameAs :clark .
:LoisB { :superman :canDo :flying . }
:lois :believes :LoisB . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
:LoisC { :superman :canDo :flying . }
:lois :supposes :LoisC . :supposes a dec:conjecturalPredicate .
# identity asserted INSIDE a doxastic world substitutes locally
:JimmyB { :superman owl:sameAs :clark . :superman :canDo :flying . }
:jimmy :believes :JimmyB .
